    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Cinq amis d'enfance r\u00eavent depuis toujours d'habiter en colocation. Lorsque l\u2019occasion d\u2019emm\u00e9nager ensemble se pr\u00e9sente, Julia, Vadim, Nestor et Timoth\u00e9e n\u2019h\u00e9sitent pas une seule seconde, surtout quand Samuel se propose de payer la moiti\u00e9 du loyer ! A peine install\u00e9s, Samuel se retrouve sur la paille mais d\u00e9cide de ne rien dire aux autres et d'assumer sa part en se mettant \u00e0 vendre de l'herbe. Mais n'est pas dealer qui veut et quand tout d\u00e9g\u00e9n\u00e8re, Samuel n\u2019a d\u2019autres choix que de se tourner vers la seule famille qu'il lui reste : ses amis !",
        "english": "Five childhood friends have always dreamed of sharing an apartment together. When the opportunity arises, Julia, Vadim, Nestor, and Timoth\u00e9e don't hesitate a single instant, particularly when Samuel offers to pay half the rent! They've barely moved in when Samuel finds himself without a dime, but he decides to say nothing to the others and to stick to their deal by selling grass. But you can't become a dealer just like that and when everything goes AWOL, Samuel has no other choice but to turn to the only family he has left: his friends."
    },
